		[i:DestroyerTest/ShadowScepter] A shadowflame shot,
		[i:DestroyerTest/StellarFoxScepter] A galantine burn shot,
		[i:DestroyerTest/RiftScepter] A Heliouric Shot,
		[i:DestroyerTest/InfectedScepter] A Cursed Flame shot,
		[i:DestroyerTest/InfectedScepter] An Ichor shot
		All shots will inflict their respective debuff.
		The thrown scepter has a larger, sweeping hitbox that doesnt affect tile collision.
		The thrown scepter also releases shimmering sparks that home in on enemies after a brief pause.
		'''
}

